 "notes": "All five planned kinds kept. Old JetPens-led model lists (a retailer-skew finding) were reorganised: Jetstream, Acroball, F-301, G2, Sarasa, Signo, Hi-Tec-C, Juice, EnerGel, FriXion, Vision/Eye, V5/V7 and multi pens became archetypes with versions; the remaining old models stay in m. Machined-pen boutique makers (Schon DSGN, Retro 51, Kakimori, Nahvalur) kept as flat models without register entries (no page retrieved). Old ranges Kaweco Sport and Leuchtturm Drehgriffel dropped as duplicates of models. Not added: Uni-ball One, ZENTO, Pentel EnerGel and Signo launch years, Fisher Bullet year (only search snippets), Montblanc 163/164 model numbers (not on retrieved page), Cross Century materials beyond what penhero gives. Pen refill reorganised by refill standard (G2 Parker-style, D1, Pilot G2 size, SXR). unsharpen.com and spacepen.com blocked WebFetch and were retrieved via firecrawl. Brand facts for Bic, Parker, Cross, Uni, Zebra, Pilot, Pentel, Sakura from knowledge."
